After updating the Go libraries, update this list and the license texts. The modules that end
up in the program are listed by:
  go list -deps -f '{{with .Module}}{{.Path}}@{{.Version}}{{end}}' ./cmd/ssh-app | sort -u
The test web/lizenzen_test.go fails if a license text is missing or the license page does not
link it.

When updating noVNC, replace web/static/vendor/novnc/ with the folders core/ and vendor/ of the
new npm package @novnc/novnc, leave the files unmodified, and update the version and the license
texts (LICENSE.txt, AUTHORS, docs/LICENSE.*, vendor/pako/LICENSE, the header of core/crypto/des.js)
here and in web/static/vendor/licenses/.
